_renamed() {
  cat <<'MESSAGE'
==> Trackknife is Melody now (ADR-0287).

The program is melody, its menu entry Melody. At its first start its
settings, tabs and cache move once from Trackknife's folders
(~/.config/trackknife, ~/.local/share/trackknife, ~/.cache/trackknife) to
melody's; the engine moves its library to ~/.local/share/melody/engine as
it restarts. Nothing has to be done by hand.

Setup and servers: /usr/share/doc/melodyd-git/melody.md
MESSAGE
}

post_install() {
  _renamed
}

post_upgrade() {
  _renamed
}
